inues to shine, mercilessly drying up what little water remains in the earth.\nSlowly, but surely, everything fades away to nothing in this Dusk World.\n\nIn the Dusk Sea that drains people's will to live lies a town of oasis located on the south.\n\nTwo young alchemists, with challenges that differ between each one, move forward together as they pursue the truth behind the Dusk once they cross paths.", "summary": "Atelier Shallie: Alchemists of the Dusk Sea is a Japanese role-playing video game developed by Gust. As part of the \"Atelier\" series of games, it is the third and final installment of the \"Dusk\" storyline. The game's story takes place about 10 years after the beginning of Atelier Ayesha: The Alchemist of Dusk and 6 years after the beginning of Atelier Escha & Logy: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky. The player is able to choose to play as one of two characters, each with a differing storyline and adventure; regardless of which character is chosen, the flow of the game remains the same. In comparison to previous Atelier games, fields are significantly larger, and the player is able to harvest a wider variety of items and raw materials to use for mixing.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/atelier-shallie-alchemists-of-the-dusk-sea", "videos": [{"id": 4789, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "LKfpYAWBGNQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LKfpYAWBGNQ", "title": "Atelier Shallie: Alchemists of the Dusk Sea - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LKfpYAWBGNQ/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196243, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "XnYzIpze0oo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XnYzIpze0oo", "title": "ATELIER SHALLIE - BATTLE GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XnYzIpze0oo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196244, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "ojC9dcH7SAE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ojC9dcH7SAE", "title": "ATELIER SHALLIE - SYNTHESIS (SHALLISTERA) GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ojC9dcH7SAE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196245, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "sOfE2qSuSpQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sOfE2qSuSpQ", "title": "ATELIER SHALLIE - SYNTHESIS (SHALLOTTE) GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sOfE2qSuSpQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196246, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "g1zp2ocrR0s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1zp2ocrR0s", "title": "ATELIER SHALLIE - DOWSING GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g1zp2ocrR0s/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196247, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "w4clnbbNdFA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w4clnbbNdFA", "title": "ATELIER SHALLIE - FISHING & MINING (SHALLOTTE) GAMEPLAY", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w4clnbbNdFA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 196248, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "y6sX6BHn_tg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y6sX6BHn_tg", "title": "Atelier Shallie: Alchemists of the Dusk Sea Storyteller", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/y6sX6BHn_tg/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2501, "name": "Atelier: Dusk"}]}